  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n#10898 added `readonly attribute Element? sourceElement;` to the [`NavigateEvent`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#navigateevent) IDL, but didn't add a corresponding `Element? sourceElement = null;` to [`NavigateEventInit`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#navigateeventinit).",
